  "answer": "Mr. Darbey is an officer of the Hussars, and his status as an officer is what brings him into contact with The Dean and Sheba. The Dean sees him when he and Major Tarver visit the Deanery to inquire about The Dean's cold, and Sheba speaks to him during that visit and later when he proposes to her.",
